# The build stage copies pyproject.toml, README.md and src/ explicitly, so this
# file exists to keep the context small (tools/ and artifacts/ alone are ~680 MB)
# and to guarantee no local corpus, venv or credential is ever sent to the daemon.

*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
src/**/__pycache__/
src/**/*.pyc
src/*.egg-info/
